      "locked": false,
      "text": "Traces depends from Broker - some may be absent\n\n- Centralized Distribution Events and Messages\n- Storing the traces\n- Comfiguring the Seperate 3rd party agents\n- Making payments - agent is bought\n    - Agent can be boight and reconfgured or \n+ Additional features - these features allows to share and expand the agent awareness\n\n\n\nStandalone features:\n\n- Exploring agents - To get the best agent to the task it supposes todo\n    - Relation Graph for better communication\n    - Skills\n    - Tasks\n    - Knowledge\n\nEssential Characteristic:\n- Agent Broker is one responsible for sending the list of agents so for some agent or user it can hide some agents - e.g: base on subscription plan",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traces depends from Broker - some may be absent\n\n- Centralized Distribution Events and Messages\n- Storing the traces\n- Comfiguring the Seperate 3rd party agents\n- Making payments - agent is bought\n    - Agent can be boight and reconfgured or \n+ Additional features - these features allows to share and expand the agent awareness\n\n\n\nStandalone features:\n\n- Exploring agents - To get the best agent to the task it supposes todo\n    - Relation Graph for better communication\n    - Skills\n    - Tasks\n    - Knowledge\n\nEssential Characteristic:\n- Agent Broker is one responsible for sending the list of agents so for some agent or user it can hide some agents - e.g: base on subscription plan",
